**/.git
**/node_modules
**/vendor
**/var
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/.env
**/.env.*
dev-book
scripts
*.md

# Docus documentation images are built from the repository root because the
# dev-book site symlinks its content to dev-book/. The showcase-recruiter-webapp-saas and api sites
# embed their content in place (docs/showcase-recruiter-webapp-saas/content, docs/api/content).
!dev-book
!dev-book/**
!docs
!docs/**
docs/**/node_modules
docs/**/.nuxt
docs/**/.output
docs/**/.data
